WEBVTT

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.730
<i>TURN</i>

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:05.190
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.110
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:06.690
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:07.110
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.270
<i>Although l imagined it'd turn out this way...</i>

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.300
<i>It's still the sort of situation one must see to believe.</i>

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:34.320
<i>The spats between the Moonrace and Terrans...</i>

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.260
<i>It's the sort of problem which won't be solved by the use of force alone.</i>

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:43.320
<i>Because of this, I've decided I can't lie any longer.</i>

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.290
<b>Corin Called It
"Gundam"</b>

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.400
All hands, Unload the cargo from the carrier...

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.950
...and remember to make sure the inventory matches the checklist.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.700
That's the last container.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.730
Alright!

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.210
Three Mobile Suits?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.530
There's nothing like this on the list...

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.110
That man...

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.820
Do you know him?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.610
That man is more dangerous than any explosive device we've received!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.820
He's that dangerous?

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.520
If he's there in front of us... then...

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.790
He must've been pardoned from his sentence in the Army's prison.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.290
Army prison?

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.740
That man was originally sentenced to suspended animation.

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.720
I'm Bruno, from the Corin Nander independent corps.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.100
and I'm Jacop. Nice to meet you.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:27.010
I've heard people talk about how the Earth's is green everywhere...

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:30.060
But it's really more colorful than I even expected.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.900
Report this to Lieutenant Harry of the Soleil Guards immediately.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:34.810
Yes!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.320
Hey, which one of you's Zenoa?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:41.110
If you mean Lieutenant Zenoa, he's currently leading an excavation mission.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.820
What? You mean he's not here?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:48.830
Well, I guess that means I'll need to borrow a bed for the night. I just wanted to greet him.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.250
Still, I look forward to working with you.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.500
Sergeant!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.700
What was that?

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:02.010
- Is he some sort of idiot?
- Looks that way.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.720
Funny? Was that Funny?

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.220
No...

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.600
You were laughing at me, right?

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.100
No!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.810
Umm...Yes?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.220
Were ya?

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:20.650
Earth's gravity is something else, isn't it?

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.110
Who the heck would approve sending him down here?

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.910
I guess they released him to help support the Earth Return operation.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.120
Did the execs at the top here have anything to do with this?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.620
Hard to say...

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.710
Someone's been smuggling cargo onboard that's not on the supply list.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.960
I doubt our superiors down here are even supposed to know about it.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.220
Have you read the newspaper?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.600
I've read the same article over and over again.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.110
The one who wishes to peacefully connect the citizens of the Moonrace and Earth.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.190
The mechanical Doll, White Doll.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.320
It's pilot is of the Moonrace.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.030
I don't understand it.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.700
What's that?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:12.490
The reasons why a simplistic and honest looking fellow like him came down from the mountains and gave us his support.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:14.910
The pilot's named Laura.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.000
However...

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.790
Everyone knows that Loran and Laura are the same person, do they not?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.300
That's not necessarily the case.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.220
What do you mean?

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:29.430
Only a few people actually know that they're the same person.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.310
Myself and my people...

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.600
Yourself, and your sister, Miss Sochie.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.730
I suppose that's right.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:41.820
Since Dianna Counter believes that there really is a person named Laura, just as this article claims...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.110
...we could even call this good news.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.280
You think we could use this to our advantage in the future?

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.900
Yes.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.110
- He's not here?
- Yeah.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.500
He didn't tell me where he went, or when he would be back.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.050
- I see, then.
- I'm sorry about that.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:06.010
No, I was just dropping by.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.510
Oh, I am Loran.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.010
I know that.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.720
Then, tell him that I came to wish him the best of luck when he returns

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.920
I will.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.400
Keith, You are who you are.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.520
You should stay with the people of the earth.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.320
Are you Loran Cehack?

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.910
Yes, that's me.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.700
- Come with us.
 - Where do you want me to go?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.190
You'll find out.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:42.790
I see. You haven't been able to reach Loran.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.750
Yes.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.920
Sister, we were all tricked!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.420
I was speaking with Mr. Guin...

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.430
I take it you've read the newspaper.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.220
l was there.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.510
Loran has been lying to all of us!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.600
I gave him a good beating for tricking us like that!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.390
You're rather energetic about this.

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.810
He deserves it! What he did is unforgivable!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.320
What's more...

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.900
What is it?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:10.030
We've had to rely on him to fend off our enemies...

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.820
And ask him to protect us!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.830
It's shameful.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.490
And my sister sees it as nothing!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:21.160
Well, I can't exactly say that I'm happy to hear it...

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.790
So then, Sochie...

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.290
Why don't you try to pilot the White Doll?

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.210
Sir Guin, do you really mean that?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.130
Since you don't want us to rely on the Moonrace's Laura...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.430
...it's what must be done.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.470
Yes! I'll drive it for you!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.130
Excellent!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.130
Sochie...

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.100
You don't need to remind me...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.730
I'll use the White Doll myself...

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.770
In order to get revenge for our father!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.020
You want revenge that badly?

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.120
Yo! It's been a while, Loran Cehack.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.290
Yes.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.500
Something wrong?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.000
Uh, no...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.420
You've been down here on earth for awhile before we arrived.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.510
And Lieutenant Poe brought you to see us last time.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.510
So what is it?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.430
- Have you seen this article?
- Yes.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:25.440
It says the Mustached Mobile Suit's pilot wants to be the bridge between the earth's people and ourselves, and it also claims the pilot's from the Moonrace.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.730
Yes.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.320
I also recall that the pilot's name is Laura.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.110
That's what it says.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:31.900
However...

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.700
Our own data doesn't mention any such female pilot.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.700
Is that so?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.910
Do you know where this pilot named Laura's located?

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.910
You are, after all, one of the Militia soldiers.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.620
Even if I'm in the Militia...

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.630
It's a big organization.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:50.210
So, then just where do they store the Mustached Mobile Suit at?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.710
As a fellow member of the Moonrace...

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.010
...I'm sure you'd like to know that.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.430
Very true.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:09:00.010
Could it really have been something the Terrans created? I'd love to know that for myself.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:04.020
In order to avoid war, it would be best if that thing simply disappeared.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.310
This is for Her Majesty Dianna's sake, as well.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.650
Lieutenant Harry!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.020
- Lieutenant Harry! What are you...
- Take care of him.
-Yes.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:12.100
Loran, and Laura, is it?

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.100
Lieutenant. Please let me out of here!

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.700
I don't know what you mean!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.610
I told you, that's enough!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.500
The map says that this is the mountain...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.250
But we haven't even found as much as a Mobile Suit leg yet.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.710
Lieutenant Zenoa...

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:32.000
The Sergeant Corin that wanted to meet you earlier...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.510
He hasn't been by here, has he?

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.090
Corin Nander, huh? No, he hasn't.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:40.600
You've memorized the first 10 pages of the instruction manual, right?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.930
Yes!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.520
We already know how to fly an airplane. It's the same basic concept.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.440
Strafing can prove a bit more difficult.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.400
It's on page 12 of the manual. Got it?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.520
Let me show you first. Watch me.

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.890
First, let's do some warm ups.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.660
The white Mobile Suit isn't here...

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:07.330
Sergeant, let's go back.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.120
We'll be in real trouble if Lieutenant Zenoa finds out we've disobeyed his orders.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.700
It must be hiding. I'll have to grab its attention.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.620
Look out!

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.130
Is it an attack!?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.930
Yes! Running can be considered training as well!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.510
The Mustache can wait... for now, I'll play with you!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.810
Show yourself, you white mustached bastard!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:40.520
Some alien isn't going to beat me!

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.950
Miashei too?

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.610
Damn!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.500
Hang on...

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.710
I'm alright.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:04.930
What?

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.800
What is it? The enemy's attacking our encampment right now!

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.220
Come on out, white mustache.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:17.650
The Great Corin Nander is here waiting for you...

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:22.310
Don't you realize your true name is Gundam!?

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:30.150
The Lieutenant may or may not believe that a pilot named Laura exists.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:34.910
But he also may just want more information on the White Doll.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:39.480
It's no good... I can't tell him.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:42.050
I don't know the full scope of things.

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.800
I could give it to Queen Dianna...

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.810
No, that would make the balance crumble.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:52.090
Then Dianna Counter would violently overpower the earth's people.

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:57.320
I can't let anybody, not even Queen Dianna, have the chance to do that.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.650
Right, Miss Mary?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.730
The Lieutenant asked to me to give you this.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.820
You'll be allowed to leave soon.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.610
This is not a prison.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.580
Keith?

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:10.200
Please let me see Queen Dianna!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.820
Now THAT I can't allow!

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.130
If I go with you...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.800
I'll definitely get the chance to speak with Colonel Michael, correct?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.800
Don't ask the same question over and over again.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.290
Sorry...

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.740
I have Loran's instruction manual.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.620
Right, I'm not too worried about it.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.330
But still, it's a mechanical doll!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.830
I understand your concern for your sister's safety,

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:58.200
...however, a person who dedicates their heart to something could increase their own abilities by five or even ten times.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.000
And even Luck may be on their side.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.210
Yes.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:05.040
Sir Guin...

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.720
The White Doll belongs to the earth.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.770
I won't give it to anybody from the Moonrace like Loran!

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.810
An enemy attack?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.520
Our Mechanical Dolls were training at the time.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.940
Does Colonel Michael know about it yet?

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:20.980
Yes.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.900
Looks like Dianna finally made the first move.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.840
The enemy scouts seem to be moving.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.130
But, They haven't moved their troops forward yet.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.640
Our enemies believe...

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.220
...that this area is an important food storage facility.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:55.370
It looks like I'll need reinforcements. Please allow me to take care of them.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:56.600
- Do it.
- Right.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.390
What?

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:00.810
Umm...Would you allow me to speak with you, Colonel Michael?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.940
And you are?

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:05.030
I am Keith Laijie, from the bakery.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.110
I'd like to sell you a mechanical doll.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:11.070
Sell a mechanical doll? What do you mean?

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.120
Look, I know where one is.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:17.040
I know of a mechanical doll that's hidden in the mountains.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.290
It's just outside of Vicinity.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:25.510
I wouldn't lie. I badly need the money, so I'm hoping you'll be willing to make the transaction.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.840
Money?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:31.430
I'd like to build a facility for the Militia that produces loads of bread!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.630
Alright, then.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.320
Inform the Colonel!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.810
I'm going!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:55.410
Hey! I am attacking the Militia!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.210
I'll conquer your farmland!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:02.670
Mustached Gundam, show yourself before me!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.920
Understood.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.420
It's the first report of this new mechanical doll type.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.630
- Anything from Loran?
- Nothing so far.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.510
They're attacking our territory place by place?

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.640
It's the Dianna Counter.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.250
They are apparently increasing their capabilities for war.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.020
My hip hurts like crazy.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.140
What? Did something happen?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.100
Miss Sochie Heim.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.520
What is it?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.520
Sir Guin Rhineford!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:27.430
I'm sorry, Miss Kihel.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.110
Am I going to go and attack them?

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.530
No, just go out on a recon mission.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.820
Although It would be good if you could stop the enemy.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:37.200
But Sochie just started to learn how to control the mechanical doll!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.620
That is true.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.410
I'll go, even if I'm not yet qualified to do it.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.830
An investigation should be enough.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:46.340
The White Doll only needs to be active enough so that Dianna Counter is able to see it.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.540
Sure.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.560
- Is it Corin Nander?
- Yes.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:54.010
I have his prison ID number and everything.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.390
Why is that man here on the Earth?

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:59.020
I was surprised when I found this out!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.730
He gave me some bizarre story, claiming he's under my command.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.230
Will there be problems with putting Corin on the frontlines?

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.820
He tends to ignore military protocols.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.030
Corin's quite the passionate man.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.410
That's why he was imprisoned.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.320
And no one granted him amnesty?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.530
Well...

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.540
That is an internal problem.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.830
It's unrelated to our concerns over relations with the Terrans.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.330
Perhaps, but if were were to allow him to remain on the front...

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.420
Then what should be done?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.500
Please allow me to take care of it.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.630
You?

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.630
Well, not me specifically.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.120
Very well.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.640
But...

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.430
I'm not even sure if the Militia knows where this Laura lives.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.520
That's why I'll rely on you instead.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.600
There will be a problem if our mobile suits get involved.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:44.600
I understand.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.440
- Take your bike.
-Yes.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.230
I'm counting on you, Loran Cehack.

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:11.340
If anything happens to Milady Sochie...

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.630
Laura!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.010
I will hold you responsible, Sir Guin.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.840
- Laura!
-Loran!

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:18.010
The Militia Kapools have been sent out, Laura!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.930
Sir Guin...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.140
I have already notified Colonel Michael.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:26.020
Despite what Laura believes, Sochie isn't going to head too far out.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.220
I believe in the Militia's abilities...

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:33.820
I... may have been putting too much trust in Sir Guin's orders lately...

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.910
Those people...they used Milady Sochie's feelings.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.230
The fools asked her to go to war for them!

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.330
Come out, Mustached Gundam!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.080
It's no fun for me to play with these losers!

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:51.820
- Gundam?
- What is he talking about?

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.010
Keep going! Put out those fires!

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:57.840
The enemy mechanical doll...
- The White Doll's on its way here!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.510
Armored cars are coming as well!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.430
Little Gundam, get out here!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.520
Gundam! Gunda...

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.220
Is that you!?

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:15.230
I'll have a ton of fun playing with you!

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.110
The White Doll and that Mobile Suit...

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.030
He kept calling "Gundam"!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:22.940
That's what the enemy called it.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.120
Not good. I went too far ahead.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.910
Nobody told me there would be three of them!

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.010
Those things rarely come out and fight bare-handed!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.720
Jacop and Bruno...

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.470
l won't forgive you if you get in the way!

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:45.130
He's going to...

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.200
I don't even have a machine gun?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.440
You're making this easy, Gundam!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.290
What is that, can you grab it?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.330
You won't fool me!

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.840
I will fire if you don't drop your weapon!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:21.540
Huh? The pilot's a woman?

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.010
It's coming this way!

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.480
Why haven't you called in support from the artillery troops yet?

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.020
Is that Loran?

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.890
- You know him?
- Yes, I do.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:33.230
Is Sochie the one who's fighting him?

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.430
You won't scare me!

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.110
What!?

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:42.940
Don't underestimate me!

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.240
Sochie!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:00.120
I got careless when I realized it's a girl...

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.920
And now I'm all dizzy...

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:08.010
Milady!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:10.350
Loran, don't you touch me!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:12.550
Why are you still here?

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.100
I can't allow someone of the Moonrace...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:17.220
...to control the White Doll!

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.230
Milady?

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.030
Now the whole world's spinning...

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:34.210
Please, rest over here!

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.120
Is Loran controlling it?

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.460
Please, take care of her!

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:43.920
Here it comes!

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.640
You stubborn woman...

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.630
This time, I'm serious!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.610
I CHALLENGE YOU!

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.660
Its movements are improving!?

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.290
Sergeant, what now? Are we to retreat?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.940
You two!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:41.820
Earth's gravity is too much for me to handle...

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.030
To me right now, this entire earth...

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.240
...is moving like a Merry-Go-Round that's spinning like crazy!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.740
Bruno...

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.330
Let's wait for the boss to get used to gravity!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.620
Roger!

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.000
We at least collected intel on our enemy's capabilities.

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:05.550
A Beam Saber?

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:07.970
There is one behind each shoulder...

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:11.500
But I couldn't use a weapon like that!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:16.130
I don't think Dianna Counter's going to declare war just yet.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:43.230
<i>It started out as a simple little prank.</i>

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:47.780
<i>Queen Dianna wanted to see what her own back looks like...</i>

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:48.940
<i>And Milady Kihel wanted...</i>

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:52.820
<i>...to live as a different person for a while.</i>

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>But that choice led these two people to experience many great challenges.</i>

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:01.210
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:03.120
<i>"The Visit to a Grave"</i>

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:06.330
"The wind sings farewell to thee..."

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>The Visit to a Grave</b>
